---
args: { mandates: ProtocolMandate[], resources: ResourceAssessment[], snapshot: ResearchOperationsSnapshot }
returns: RescueAlternative[]
---
For each substitute candidate compare measurement behavior and validated-use evidence to the protocol requirement. Equal capability labels do not establish equal behavior. A changed measurement produces a qualified-substitute proposal with the exact scientific deviation, named investigator review, and approval required; unresolved behavior remains blocked.
